  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_6597.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(40 fotos) El CD Onda ha ganado la noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles 4-1 al cuadro juvenil de Divisi&oacute;n de Honor del CD Castell&oacute;n, con dos goles de Andoni, otro de Borja y un &uacute;ltimo de Gian, en partido disputado en La Seratella y dirigido por el segundo entrenador, Enrique Sanf&eacute;lix.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6597.jpg\" alt=\"img_6597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6599.jpg\" alt=\"img_6599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6600.jpg\" alt=\"img_6600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6603.jpg\" alt=\"img_6603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6606.jpg\" alt=\"img_6606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6607.jpg\" alt=\"img_6607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6608.jpg\" alt=\"img_6608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilhonorcdcastello190815/img_6609.jpg\" alt=\"img_6609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondajuvenilh